---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Manuel Valle Torre - Learning Analytics"
  description="PhD Student in Learning Analytics at TU Delft"
>
  <Header slot="header" />
  
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    
    <!-- Hero Section: Editorial Style -->
    <section class="flex flex-col-reverse md:flex-row gap-12 items-start mb-20 border-b-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 pb-12">
      <div class="flex-1 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-analog-serif font-black tracking-tighter text-black dark:text-white leading-[0.9]">
            Manuel<br/>Valle Torre
          </h1>
          <div class="mt-4 inline-block border-2 border-black dark:border-white px-3 py-1">
             <p class="font-analog-mono text-sm tracking-widest uppercase font-bold">
               AI Engineer & Researcher
             </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <p class="text-xl font-analog-serif text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 leading-relaxed max-w-prose">
          Bridging the gap between <span class="font-analog-mono text-base bg-yellow-100 dark:bg-yellow-900/30 px-1">User Behavior</span> and <span class="font-analog-mono text-base bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 px-1">Technical AI Systems</span>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Profile Photo: Polaroid Style -->
      <div class="w-full md:w-64 flex-shrink-0 rotate-3 transform transition-transform hover:rotate-0 duration-300">
        <div class="bg-white p-3 shadow-xl border border-gray-200">
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500">
            <img src="/assets/img/Profile 2025 Small.png" alt="Manuel Valle Torre" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 pb-2 text-center">
             <span class="font-analog-mono text-xs text-gray-500">Fig. 1: The Author, 2025</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Content: Letter/Article Style -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1fr,300px] gap-12">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Biography -->
      <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert font-analog-serif text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">
        <p>
          I specialize in designing and evaluating AI-driven educational environments. I engineer the full <span class="font-analog-mono text-sm">Interaction_Pipeline</span> where humans and AI meet, ensuring systems are both technically robust and pedagogically effective.
        </p>
        <p>
          This involves engineering <span class="font-analog-mono text-sm">Multi_Agent_Architectures</span> (using DSPy optimizers) that orchestrate agent classifiers, experts, and tutors within real-world environments.
        </p>
        <p>
          My core focus is on <span class="font-analog-mono text-sm">Context_Engineering</span>—integrating runtime state (code, errors, objectives) into adaptive pipelines—and evaluating system performance using <span class="font-analog-mono text-sm">Granular_Trace_Metrics</span> derived from authentic user research.
        </p>
        <p>
          This research powers <a href="/reports/jelai" class="font-bold underline decoration-dotted hover:text-black">JELAI</a>, a Jupyter-based platform I built to capture these rich interaction signals in real-time.
        </p>
        <p>
          Previously at the Web Information Systems group (TU Delft), I worked on data-intensive systems. I balance my technical work with music, cycling, and engineering my own <a href="/sauces" class="analog-highlighter px-1">hot sauces</a>.
        </p>
        
        <div class="mt-8 font-analog-mono text-sm border-t pt-4 border-gray-300 flex justify-between items-center text-gray-500">
          <div>
            <span class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mb-1 opacity-70">Status:</span>
            <span class="text-green-600 font-bold">● OPEN TO WORK</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right">
             <span class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mb-1 opacity-70">Downloads:</span>
             <a href="/assets/MVT_CV_2025_AI.pdf" target="_blank" class="hover:bg-black hover:text-white px-1 transition-colors font-bold underline decoration-2">[FULL_RESUME_V2025]</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Featured Item (Index Card) -->
      <aside class="space-y-8">
        <div class="bg-[#Fdfbf7] dark:bg-gray-800 border-2 border-black dark:border-white p-6 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] dark:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(255,255,255,1)]">
          <div class="border-b-2 border-black dark:border-white pb-2 mb-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="font-analog-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase">Report No. 001</span>
            <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500 border border-black"></div>
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="font-analog-serif text-2xl font-bold leading-tight mb-3">
            AI in Education – The Missing Link
          </h3>
          
          <p class="font-analog-serif text-sm opacity-80 mb-6">
            An interactive walk-through explaining the risks of deploying GenAI without a Learning Analytics feedback loop.
          </p>

          <a href="/reports/ai-in-education/" class="block text-center border-2 border-black dark:border-white py-2 font-analog-mono text-sm font-bold hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase">
            Read Report ->
          </a>
        </div>
      </aside>

    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>